00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:39.460
Hubert (ChainSecurity): And because that trick always works, it also does not really check the return value, of the self-destruct trick. So you could now say, this is not great coding practice, and, yeah, that can, of course be argued, but that's kind of not what I want to discuss, because,

