00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:38.910
Hubert (ChainSecurity): So, this is a contract that is safe with Osaka rules. Why is it safe? Because if there's sufficient gas, the safety structures works, and all is fine. If the self-destruct runs out of gas, the victim will only have 1 over 64 gas left.

